MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

JpegDecoder::decode_planes runs the decoder's own baseline or progressive
path with a flag that makes post_process copy each row of MCUs (raw_coeff,
the IDCT's clamped output) into its component's plane, cropped to
ceil(W*h/h_max) x ceil(H*v/v_max), instead of upsampling and converting.
qt_tables are handed out in natural order as u16. Nothing else is made
public, and no existing call's output changes. See PATCH.md.
